    "Timers are inclusive: tstep_grid_vel contains fxynl/mapgrids/exch_edges, and tstep_grid_hgt contains hxynl/mapgrids/outsea/exch_edges/recheck_wod. Never sum a parent and its children.",
    "Timer maxima from different regions generally occur on different ranks; their sum is not an elapsed critical path. MPI edge exchange includes waiting for slower ranks.",
    "Calls of tstep and nested wrappers include time-nesting skipped work; compare the identical grid hierarchy and dt schedule.",
    "Source-frame counts remain 546 in the 1800 s prefix; their share rises because initialization and source generation are not proportional to total duration. Output begins at 360 s, so output duty differs from the full run.",
    "All-rank mean shares and per-rank times preserve load imbalance information that rank 0 alone hides. Comparisons require matching MPI topology, I/O policy, compiler options, and hardware.",
    "Missing timer entries are null, not zero. Means/min/max use only observed ranks; observed_ranks records their count."
